{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e44ad37f-72a9-8dfd-8f69-1cf7a7a9a44c",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T12:12:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Omar Nguyen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:08:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:08:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes, good afternoon. I'm sorry to bother you. Is this the right number for trash and recycling? I'm not sure I dialed correctly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:08:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got the right place. What can I help you with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:08:26-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, my recycling bin is gone. The blue one. I put it out at the curb for pickup on Friday morning, and it was there. Then the storm came, Saturday into Sunday, the nor'easter, and when I went to look yesterday, it wasn't anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:08:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So it went out Friday for pickup, and you noticed it missing Sunday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:08:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. I didn't bring it back in after the truck came. I should have, I know. I'm sorry about that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:08:57-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no need to apologize. It happens a lot, especially with wind like we had. Bins get blown down the street or picked up by somebody who thinks it's theirs. Did you look around the neighbors' yards?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:09:11-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I did, I walked up and down a little. I'm careful on the sidewalk, so not too far. I didn't see it. It had my apartment number written on the side in marker, so I thought somebody might have found it, but no."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:09:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Then you'd want to request a replacement. Can I get your name first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:09:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's Omar Nguyen. N-G-U-Y-E-N. Is that how you want it? I can spell the first name too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:09:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Last name's fine, I've got Omar. And I'll need the address where the bin was picked up, the service address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:09:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. I'd rather not say it over the phone if that's all right. Is that going to be a problem? I can say it another way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:09:58-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm. Well, I do need it to put in the request. Let me tell you what we can do. I can take your phone number and have someone from the department call you back to confirm the location. Would that work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:10:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that would be fine. Thank you. The number is 401-555-0173. Did I say that clearly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:10:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one seven three. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:10:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:10:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'll note the blue recycling bin, missing after Friday's pickup, possibly lost in the storm. Anything else about it? Was there a lid?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:10:37-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There was a lid, yes, attached. Just the standard one. Oh, and it was the recycling one only. The trash I keep inside, so that's not missing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:10:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Just the recycling bin and lid."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:10:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is there a charge for a new one? I should ask that, I suppose. I'm not sure how it works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:10:59-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Whoever calls you back will go over that with you. I don't want to tell you the wrong thing about cost. Usually they'll tell you how it gets delivered and when."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:11:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I'll wait for the call. Do you know about how long it might be? I'm sorry, I don't mean to rush anyone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:11:20-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're not rushing anyone. After a storm like this we get a pile of these, so give it a few business days. If you don't hear anything by end of the week, call us back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:11:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few business days, and then call back Friday if nothing. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:11:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:11:41-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'll write that down. I was at the bakery this morning and ended up talking with a gentleman there for a very long time, a complete stranger, and I nearly forgot to call you. He was telling me about his own bins blowing away, and then we kept talking about everything else. It was a long conversation."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:12:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'm glad you remembered. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:12:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I think that's everything. Did I do this correctly? The request is in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:12:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's in. Someone will call you back at that number about the replacement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:12:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much, Denise. I appreciate your help. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T12:12:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Nguyen. Take care."
    }
  ],
